<title>ITALY: Italy's Deroma to make bourse debut Monday.</title>
<headline>Italy's Deroma to make bourse debut Monday.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian terracotta pot maker Deroma Holding will be listed on the Milan stock exchange from Monday March 3, the bourse authority said.</p>
<p>Its quotation follows a succesful global placement of 5.6 million ordinary shares at 10,000 lire each.</p>
<p>The Vicenza-based company, established in 1955, had estimated 1996 turnover of 114 billion lire against 107 billion in 1995, with some 80 percent coming from abroad.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
